  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_00",
      "hash64": "6C76D0975AF7CD8E",
      "text": "感谢你设置道具打印机。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_01",
      "hash64": "6C76D1975AF7CF41",
      "text": "我是科学社的社员，\\n道具打印机就是本社团开发的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_02",
      "hash64": "6C76CE975AF7CA28",
      "text": "而我拜访各位的社团活动室\\n是来向大家说明如何操作的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_03",
      "hash64": "6C76CF975AF7CBDB",
      "text": "请容我直入正题，\\n所谓道具打印机就是……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_04",
      "hash64": "6C76D4975AF7D45A",
      "text": "把宝可梦的掉落物放进去，\\n再注入ＢＰ，\\r\\n就能转换出道具的装置！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_05",
      "hash64": "6C76D5975AF7D60D",
      "text": "它的构造可是机密哦！\\n因为正在申请专利之类的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_06",
      "hash64": "6C76D2975AF7D0F4",
      "text": "总之就是个把掉落物放进去！\\n就能打印出道具的优秀装置！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_07",
      "hash64": "6C76D3975AF7D2A7",
      "text": "至于会印出什么，就敬请期待吧！\\n很简单吧？所以……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_start_00",
      "hash64": "47D2451C8CF88184",
      "text": "你要用道具打印机\\n打印道具吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_con_00_00",
      "hash64": "0863983DD5491E9F",
      "text": "是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
